In these ten years here, I have witnessed countless people enter with great hopes and then watch them leave in disappointment. It's hard to find one who can stand firm among a hundred. My cousin almost became one of those ninety-nine "failures" #ETH .
Three months ago, he came to me with 30,000, looking confused. I didn't teach him any flashy tricks; I just gave him 10 pieces of advice to follow and told him not to overthink. He obediently followed my advice, and three months later, his capital surprisingly grew to 110,000, without a single liquidation throughout the process. He asked me where these words came from, and I said: it's not that I'm smart, it's that I've stepped into all the pitfalls. #SIERN 
Every painful liquidation, regretful chase up, and torment of holding positions have ultimately condensed into these 10 heartfelt words, shared with you in hopes of helping you avoid unnecessary losses:
1. Don't go all in with limited funds; just catching one big trend a year can yield great profits;
2. Don't invest blindly in projects you don't understand; following the crowd is the easiest way to lose money;
3. Be cautious when good news is realized; funds often retreat at this opportunity;
4. Reduce positions before holidays to avoid sudden large fluctuations;
5. Leave room for medium-term operations; selling high and buying low is more stable;
6. For short-term trading, only choose coins with high trading volume; low volume can’t last long;
7. A prolonged decline is most torturous; rebounds after panic selling are usually quick;
8. Cut losses promptly if you buy the wrong asset; keep your capital intact, and don’t fear missing opportunities;
9. Pay attention to the rhythm for short-term trades; use 15-minute candlesticks to find entry and exit points;
10. Don’t be greedy with trading systems; 1-2 strategies that suit you are sufficient.
Making money in the crypto world is not difficult; the hard part is staying at the table. Avoiding one pitfall is more crucial than making an extra profit. #Crypto Survival Secrets#Crypto Market Volatility
I only trade real accounts, not virtual ones. Friends who want to avoid pitfalls and achieve steady profits, don’t explore the crypto world alone. Keep up with the rhythm, Brother Jie, and earn steady money with winning strategies! 🔥
